<view class="page-recharge-result">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="card rc-result-head">
      <view class="rc-result-icon">✓</view>
      <view class="rc-result-title">充值成功</view>
      <view class="rc-result-sub">{{patientName || '—'}} 的就诊卡已到账</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="rc-row"><text class="rc-label">充值金额</text><text class="rc-amount">{{amountText}}</text></view>
      <view class="rc-row">
        <text class="rc-label">到账后余额</text>
        <text class="rc-balance">{{balanceText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="rc-row"><text class="rc-label">充值单号</text><text class="rc-order">{{orderNo || '—'}}</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="rc-note">余额用于门诊缴费（自助缴费暂未开放）；可在「我的 - 门诊充值记录」查看这笔账单</view>

    <button class="btn-primary rc-btn rc-records-btn" bindtap="onGoRecords">查看充值记录</button>
    <button class="btn-outline rc-btn rc-home-btn" bindtap="onBackHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>
</view>
